      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### How to use this dashboard\n\n1. Pick a **Service** (or **All**) and a time range - every table below filters on it.\n2. Click a row's **Trace ID** (link) to load that trace into the **Trace Inspector**.\n3. **Service Dependencies** shows call relationships built by the metrics-generator; the **RED** panels show request rate, error rate and p95 latency derived from the same traces.\n4. **Slowest / Redis / HTTP** tables surface performance problems - tune the `Duration` and `Method` dropdowns.\n5. Expand the **Error Traces** and **Trace Deep Dive** rows to see failures and the matching Loki logs for the selected trace.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "description": "Latest traces for the selected service. Click any Trace ID to open the full trace in the Trace Inspector.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Duration" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "thresholds" } },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "yellow", "value": 1000 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 5000 }
                  ]
                }
              }
